{"id":"3c4fd3dee2f60a10","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqGeneral.md","title":"SConseqGeneral","display":"SConseqGeneral","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SConseqGeneral","parameters":["F","R","f","r","g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SConseqGeneral"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SConseqGeneral F R f r g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ SForms F R f r g)\n  (and\n    (@ SFm F R f r a)\n    (forall D\n      (forall I\n        (forall J\n          (forall K\n            (forall e\n              (forall G\n                (implies\n                  (and\n                    (@ SModel F R f r D I J K)\n                    (and (= K K) (and (@ SAssign D K e G) (forall b (implies (in b g) (@ SSat F R f r D I J K e G b))))))\n                  (@ SSat F R f r D I J K e G a))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0813711a39c2290\" href=\"?note=a0813711a39c2290\" title=\"ZFC_SAssign\">SAssign</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"29a45fb50ac9d95e\" href=\"?note=29a45fb50ac9d95e\" title=\"ZFC_SFm\">SFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7b8c8061bede048c\" href=\"?note=7b8c8061bede048c\" title=\"ZFC_SForms\">SForms</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d645c141ea336a\" href=\"?note=36d645c141ea336a\" title=\"ZFC_SModel\">SModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ed1d89172a263c0a\" href=\"?note=ed1d89172a263c0a\" title=\"ZFC_SSat\">SSat</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SConseqGeneral F R f r g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SAssign","status":"resolved","id":"a0813711a39c2290","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_SAssign|SAssign]]；[[ZFC_SFm|SFm]]；[[ZFC_SForms|SForms]]；[[ZFC_SModel|SModel]]；[[ZFC_SSat|SSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SFm","status":"resolved","id":"29a45fb50ac9d95e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_SAssign|SAssign]]；[[ZFC_SFm|SFm]]；[[ZFC_SForms|SForms]]；[[ZFC_SModel|SModel]]；[[ZFC_SSat|SSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SForms","status":"resolved","id":"7b8c8061bede048c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_SAssign|SAssign]]；[[ZFC_SFm|SFm]]；[[ZFC_SForms|SForms]]；[[ZFC_SModel|SModel]]；[[ZFC_SSat|SSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SModel","status":"resolved","id":"36d645c141ea336a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_SAssign|SAssign]]；[[ZFC_SFm|SFm]]；[[ZFC_SForms|SForms]]；[[ZFC_S